{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46880","headline":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 二 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"井梧黄落暮蝉清，久驻金台但暗惊。\n事佛未怜诸弟子，谈空争动上公卿。\n合归鸟外藏幽迹，敢向人前认好名。\n满印白檀灯一醆，可能酬谢得聪明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}